keraptis mad mage~
Keraptis~
A deranged mage screams and gibbers madly.
~
Once an evil warlock and ruler of a kingdom that he
held in sway with his legions of fanatical elves,
Keraptis was overthrown, and fled to this hidden
retreat, where he has slowly gone quite mad, to the
point where much of his evil nature has been replaced
by a simply crazy one. He steals the artifacts
in a fit of pique, and is unlikely to return them,
having people perish in search of them amuses him to
no end.
~
